version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-31"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/agent-honeypot/agent-honeypot"
abstract: >-
  A defensive honeypot for LLM agents. Exposes synthetic MCP tool servers and
  canary documents, records agent behavior with digest-only persistence, and
  produces a 24-dimension fingerprint per session for detection and research
  into unauthorized autonomous agents.
